<title>FRANCE: Sodexho buys 49 pct of Ogden unit.</title>
<headline>Sodexho buys 49 pct of Ogden unit.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>French food catering and site management company Sodexho said it had bought 49 percent of Universal Ogden Services, another site management group, from U.S. Ogden Corp.</p>
<p>It said the other 51 percent would be held by International Catering Enterprises and that Universal Ogden Services would now be named Universal Services and continue to be run by current chairman Kirby MacDonald.</p>
<p>It said Universal Services had annual turnover of 700 million francs and employed 3,000 people in 10 countries.</p>
<p>It did not give price details for the acquisition.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
